    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Working Group for Women (WGW) celebrated International Women's Day jointly with the Housekeeping Department on March 26, 2004 at AKU auditorium. Shamim Usman, Chair WGW, in her welcome speech outlined the vision of WGW to create a supportive environment where men and women can work together with mutual trust and respect.",
